{
 "question_first": {
  "title": "질문이 먼저다 — 선언 + 숫자(editorial)",
  "style": "editorial",
  "layout": "fullscreen",
  "html": "<div class=\"card\" data-card-id=\"c-question\">\n<style>\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-question\"] .root{width:100%; height:100%; position:relative; overflow:hidden; box-sizing:border-box;\n  background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); padding: 120px 140px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; gap:40px;\n  font-family: var(--font-body);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-question\"] .kicker{align-self:flex-start; padding: 10px 18px; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper);\n  font: 700 28px/1 var(--font-body); letter-spacing: 0.16em;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-question\"] .title{margin:0; font: 800 128px/1.05 var(--font-head); letter-spacing:-0.02em; max-width: 90%;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-question\"] .title .hl{color: var(--accent-deep);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-question\"] .rule{height: 6px; background: var(--accent); width: 520px;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-question\"] .detail{margin:0; font: 500 40px/1.5 var(--font-body); color: var(--muted); max-width: 78%;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-question\"] .detail .mark{color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-question\"] .stat{position:absolute; right:140px; top:120px; text-align:right;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-question\"] .stat .num{font: 400 220px/0.9 var(--font-latin); color: var(--ink);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-question\"] .stat .cap{font: 600 28px/1.2 var(--font-body); color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.08em;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-question\"] .quote{position:absolute; left:140px; bottom:210px; font: italic 500 34px/1.3 var(--font-serif); color: var(--accent-deep);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-question\"] svg.sketch{position:absolute; left:60px; top:60px; width: 1800px; height: 960px; fill:none; stroke: var(--paper-line); stroke-width: 3;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"root\">\n  <svg class=\"sketch\"><path d=\"M 8 8 L 1792 12 L 1788 952 L 12 948 Z\" data-anim=\"draw-path\" data-anim-at=\"0.05\" data-anim-duration=\"0.9\"/></svg>\n  <span class=\"kicker\" data-anim=\"fade-in\" data-anim-at=\"0\" data-anim-duration=\"0.3\">오늘의 개념</span>\n  <h2 class=\"title\" data-anim=\"kinetic-chars\" data-anim-at=\"0.05\" data-anim-duration=\"0.4\" data-anim-stagger=\"0.03\">질문이 <span class=\"hl\">먼저</span>다</h2>\n  <div class=\"rule\" data-anim=\"grow-x\" data-anim-at=\"0.45\" data-anim-duration=\"0.4\" data-anim-target-w=\"520\"></div>\n  <p class=\"detail\" data-anim=\"fade-in\" data-anim-at=\"0.25\" data-anim-duration=\"0.4\">해결책부터 그리면 <span class=\"mark\" data-anim=\"highlight\" data-anim-at=\"1.7\" data-anim-duration=\"0.5\">문제를 좁게</span> 본다. 좋은 디자인은 좋은 질문에서 시작한다.</p>\n  <div class=\"stat\" data-anim=\"slide-in\" data-anim-at=\"0.1\" data-anim-distance=\"120\" data-anim-duration=\"0.45\" data-anim-from=\"right\">\n    <div class=\"num\" data-anim=\"count-up\" data-anim-at=\"0.2\" data-anim-duration=\"1.2\" data-anim-suffix=\"%\" data-anim-to=\"90\">90%</div>\n    <div class=\"cap\">해결책부터 그리는 학생</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"quote\" data-anim=\"fade-in\" data-anim-at=\"2.2\" data-anim-duration=\"0.4\">“Compression is comprehension.”</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
 },
 "definition_academic": {
  "title": "어포던스 — 용어 정의(academic, split)",
  "style": "academic",
  "layout": "split",
  "html": "<div class=\"card\" data-card-id=\"c-affordance\">\n<style>\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-affordance\"] .root{width:100%; height:100%; position:relative; overflow:hidden; padding: 64px 72px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; gap: 26px;\n  color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  background-color: var(--paper);\n  background-image: linear-gradient(var(--paper-line) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, var(--paper-line) 1px, transparent 1px);\n  background-size: 36px 36px, 36px 36px;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-affordance\"] .meta{display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap: 16px;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-affordance\"] .kicker{padding: 8px 14px; background: var(--accent-deep); color: var(--paper); font: 700 28px/1 var(--font-body); letter-spacing: 0.14em;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-affordance\"] .en{font: 500 28px/1 var(--font-latin); color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.06em;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-affordance\"] .title{margin:0; font: 700 96px/1.1 var(--font-serif); letter-spacing: 0.01em; align-self:flex-start;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-affordance\"] .detail{margin:0; font: 500 34px/1.55 var(--font-serif); color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 96%;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-affordance\"] .hl{padding: 0 4px;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-affordance\"] .note{align-self:flex-start; padding: 10px 18px; border: 2px dashed var(--accent-deep); color: var(--accent-deep); font: italic 600 28px/1.2 var(--font-serif); transform: rotate(-1.2deg);}\n</style>\n<div class=\"root\">\n  <div class=\"meta\">\n    <span class=\"kicker\" data-anim=\"fade-in\" data-anim-at=\"0\" data-anim-duration=\"0.3\">용어</span>\n    <span class=\"en\" data-anim=\"fade-in\" data-anim-at=\"0.1\" data-anim-duration=\"0.3\">AFFORDANCE</span>\n  </div>\n  <h2 class=\"title\" data-anim=\"kinetic-chars\" data-anim-at=\"0.05\" data-anim-duration=\"0.4\" data-anim-stagger=\"0.04\">어포던스</h2>\n  <p class=\"detail\" data-anim=\"fade-in\" data-anim-at=\"0.25\" data-anim-duration=\"0.4\">사물이 <span class=\"hl\" data-anim=\"highlight\" data-anim-at=\"1.5\" data-anim-duration=\"0.5\">어떻게 쓰이는지</span> 스스로 말해 주는 성질. 손잡이는 당기라고, 판은 밀라고 말한다.</p>\n  <div class=\"note\" data-anim=\"fade-in\" data-anim-at=\"2.2\" data-anim-duration=\"0.4\">\"Good design is obvious.\" — 깁슨 · 노먼</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
 },
 "compare_swiss": {
  "title": "발산 ↔ 수렴 — 비교(swiss, fullscreen)",
  "style": "swiss",
  "layout": "fullscreen",
  "html": "<div class=\"card\" data-card-id=\"c-diverge\">\n<style>\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-diverge\"] .root{width:100%; height:100%; position:relative; overflow:hidden; background: var(--white); color: var(--ink); padding: 72px 96px 196px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between; font-family: var(--font-body);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-diverge\"] .rule{height: 10px; background: var(--ink); width: 1728px;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-diverge\"] .rule.red{background: var(--accent); height: 6px;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-diverge\"] .meta{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font: 600 28px/1 var(--font-body); letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 14px;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-diverge\"] .title{margin: 24px 0 0; font: 900 120px/1.02 var(--font-head); letter-spacing: -0.03em;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-diverge\"] .title .arrow{color: var(--accent-deep);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-diverge\"] .cols{display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 64px; margin-top: 12px;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-diverge\"] .col h3{margin: 0 0 14px; font: 800 44px/1.1 var(--font-head); border-top: 6px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 14px;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-diverge\"] .col.b h3{border-top-color: var(--accent);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-diverge\"] .col ul{list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-diverge\"] .col li{font: 500 36px/1.5 var(--font-body); color: var(--ink-soft); padding-left: 34px; position: relative;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-diverge\"] .col li::before{content: \"\"; position:absolute; left: 0; top: 22px; width: 14px; height: 14px; background: var(--ink);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-diverge\"] .col.b li::before{background: var(--accent);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-diverge\"] .foot{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font: 500 28px/1 var(--font-body); letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 16px;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"root\">\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"rule\" data-anim=\"grow-x\" data-anim-at=\"0.05\" data-anim-duration=\"0.5\" data-anim-target-w=\"1728\"></div>\n    <div class=\"meta\" data-anim=\"fade-in\" data-anim-at=\"0.05\" data-anim-duration=\"0.3\"><span>더블 다이아몬드</span><span>№ 02</span></div>\n    <h2 class=\"title\" data-anim=\"fade-in\" data-anim-at=\"0.05\" data-anim-duration=\"0.35\">발산 <span class=\"arrow\">↔</span> 수렴</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cols\">\n    <div class=\"col a\"><h3 data-anim=\"slide-in\" data-anim-at=\"0.15\" data-anim-distance=\"60\" data-anim-duration=\"0.4\" data-anim-from=\"left\">발산</h3>\n      <ul data-anim=\"stagger-in\" data-anim-at=\"1.2\" data-anim-duration=\"0.4\" data-anim-stagger=\"0.12\"><li>가능성을 넓힌다</li><li>많이, 거칠게</li><li>판단은 잠시 미룬다</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"col b\"><h3 data-anim=\"slide-in\" data-anim-at=\"0.25\" data-anim-distance=\"60\" data-anim-duration=\"0.4\" data-anim-from=\"right\">수렴</h3>\n      <ul data-anim=\"stagger-in\" data-anim-at=\"1.35\" data-anim-duration=\"0.4\" data-anim-stagger=\"0.12\"><li>기준으로 고른다</li><li>적게, 정확하게</li><li>하나로 좁힌다</li></ul></div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"rule red\" data-anim=\"grow-x\" data-anim-at=\"2\" data-anim-duration=\"0.45\" data-anim-target-w=\"1728\"></div>\n    <div class=\"foot\" data-anim=\"fade-in\" data-anim-at=\"2.2\" data-anim-duration=\"0.35\"><span>DESIGN COUNCIL · 2005</span><span>넓게 → 좁게</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>"
 },
 "process_board": {
  "title": "질문 → 관찰 → 정의 — 과정(board, fullscreen)",
  "style": "board",
  "layout": "fullscreen",
  "html": "<div class=\"card\" data-card-id=\"c-process\">\n<style>\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-process\"] .root{width:100%; height:100%; position:relative; overflow:hidden; background: var(--board); color: var(--chalk); padding: 96px 120px; font-family: var(--font-body);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-process\"] .label{font: 600 28px/1 var(--font-body); color: var(--chalk-dim); letter-spacing: 0.12em;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-process\"] .title{margin: 18px 0 0; font: 800 88px/1.1 var(--font-head); color: var(--chalk);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-process\"] .steps{position:absolute; left: 120px; right: 120px; top: 440px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-process\"] .step{width: 460px;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-process\"] .num{font: 400 120px/1 var(--font-latin); color: var(--chalk-dim);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-process\"] .step.now .num{color: var(--accent-light);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-process\"] .name{font: 800 56px/1.1 var(--font-head); margin-top: 8px;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-process\"] .step.now .name{color: var(--accent-light);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-process\"] .desc{font: 500 30px/1.45 var(--font-body); color: var(--chalk-dim); margin-top: 12px;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-process\"] svg.arrows{position:absolute; left: 120px; top: 560px; width: 1680px; height: 120px; fill:none; stroke: var(--chalk-dim); stroke-width: 5; stroke-linecap: round;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-process\"] .foot{position:absolute; left: 120px; bottom: 200px; font: 500 28px/1 var(--font-body); color: var(--chalk-dim); letter-spacing: 0.08em;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"root\">\n  <div class=\"label\" data-anim=\"fade-in\" data-anim-at=\"0.05\" data-anim-duration=\"0.4\">문제를 다시 정의하는 순서</div>\n  <h2 class=\"title\" data-anim=\"mask-reveal\" data-anim-at=\"0.3\" data-anim-direction=\"left\" data-anim-duration=\"0.6\">해결책 대신 질문부터</h2>\n  <svg class=\"arrows\">\n    <path d=\"M 480 60 C 520 20, 560 20, 600 60\" data-anim=\"draw-path\" data-anim-at=\"1.5\" data-anim-duration=\"0.5\"/>\n    <path d=\"M 1080 60 C 1120 20, 1160 20, 1200 60\" data-anim=\"draw-path\" data-anim-at=\"2.3\" data-anim-duration=\"0.5\"/>\n  </svg>\n  <div class=\"steps\" data-anim=\"stagger-in\" data-anim-at=\"0.9\" data-anim-duration=\"0.5\" data-anim-stagger=\"0.4\">\n    <div class=\"step\"><div class=\"num\">01</div><div class=\"name\">질문</div><div class=\"desc\">누가, 언제, 왜 불편한가</div></div>\n    <div class=\"step now\"><div class=\"num\">02</div><div class=\"name\">관찰</div><div class=\"desc\">말이 아니라 행동을 본다</div></div>\n    <div class=\"step\"><div class=\"num\">03</div><div class=\"name\">정의</div><div class=\"desc\">한 문장으로 좁힌다</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"foot\" data-anim=\"fade-in\" data-anim-at=\"2.9\" data-anim-duration=\"0.4\">DOUBLE DIAMOND · DISCOVER → DEFINE</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
 },
 "slam_minimal": {
  "title": "문제를 정의하라 — 한 문장(minimal, fullscreen)",
  "style": "minimal",
  "layout": "fullscreen",
  "html": "<div class=\"card\" data-card-id=\"c-slam\">\n<style>\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-slam\"] .root{width:100%; height:100%; position:relative; overflow:hidden; background: var(--ink); color: var(--white); display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:center; padding: 0 160px; gap: 28px; font-family: var(--font-head);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-slam\"] .dot{width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent);}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-slam\"] .line{margin:0; font: 900 150px/1.04 var(--font-head); letter-spacing: -0.035em;}\n.card[data-card-id=\"c-slam\"] .sub{margin: 8px 0 0; font: 500 40px/1.4 var(--font-body); color: var(--chalk-dim); max-width: 1200px;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"root\">\n  <div class=\"dot\" data-anim=\"scale-pop\" data-anim-at=\"0.05\" data-anim-duration=\"0.45\"></div>\n  <h2 class=\"line\" data-anim=\"mask-reveal\" data-anim-at=\"0.3\" data-anim-direction=\"left\" data-anim-duration=\"0.7\">해결책이 아니라<br/>문제를 정의하라.</h2>\n  <p class=\"sub\" data-anim=\"fade-in\" data-anim-at=\"1.3\" data-anim-duration=\"0.5\">잘 정의된 문제는 답의 절반이다.</p>\n  <div class=\"dot\" style=\"position:absolute; right:160px; bottom:120px;\" data-anim=\"pulse\" data-anim-at=\"2\" data-anim-duration=\"0.6\" data-anim-scale=\"1.25\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>"
 }
}
